17: Constructor `Acme\Mapper::__construct()` is replaced by `\Acme\Sequence::map($iterator, $callback)`, but `parent::__construct()` creates no object to replace.
25: Constructor `Acme\Layout::__construct()` is replaced by `$this->configure($shape)`, but an instantiation has no object to call it on.
28: Property `Acme\Message::$subject` is replaced by `setSubject($value)`, but nothing says what a read of it becomes.
31: Method `Acme\Settings::spread()` is replaced by `\Acme\Sequence::invokeAll($first, ...) + \Acme\Sequence::invokeAll(...)`, but `compute()` would be evaluated 2 times.
